\frametitle{What the agent sees at turn 1}
\scriptsize
  \begin{exampleblock}{Output of \texttt{format\_patient\_info()}}
  \begin{lstlisting}
Patient: 62 yo female. CC: progressive dysarthria, dysphagia, and
  bilateral limb weakness over 8 months.
HPI: 62-yo right-handed woman with 8-month progressive dysarthria,
  dysphagia, and limb weakness. PCP ordered a cervical MRI showing
  moderate spondylosis; cervical myelopathy raised as etiology...
PMH: HTN; hypothyroidism; osteoporosis; remote right CTS released 5y ago
Exam:
  Motor: deltoids 4/5, biceps 4+/5, hand 4-/5 R, 3+/5 L. Visible
    fasciculations bilateral UE proximal muscles.
  Reflexes: hyperreflexia 3+; plantars extensor (Babinski +);
    Hoffman sign + bilaterally.
  Add'l: fasciculations in tongue, deltoids, left thenar...
Vitals: BP 128/78, HR 72, T 36.8 C, RR 14, SpO2 97%
  \end{lstlisting}
  \end{exampleblock}

  \centering\scriptsize\itshape
  No MRI report, no labs, no EMG, no CSF; the agent decides what to order.
